# SAARTHI Environment Variables Configuration
# ============================================
#
# This file is a template for environment variables.
# SAARTHI now uses local Ollama for LLM features - no API keys required!
#
# SETUP:
#   1. Install Ollama from https://ollama.ai
#   2. Start Ollama (runs automatically as a service on Windows)
#   3. Pull a model: ollama pull llama3.1
#   4. Run SAARTHI with LLM enabled
#
# No .env file or API keys needed for local operation.

# Optional: Override default Ollama model
# OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.1

# Optional: Override default Ollama endpoint
# OLLAMA_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:11434/api/generate
